--- a/docs/config.md
+++ b/docs/config.md
@@ -12,1 +12,6 @@ All settings are read once at start-up.
 | `FETCH_TIMEOUT_S` | `5` | Per-request timeout, in seconds. |
+| `MAX_ATTEMPTS` | `3` | Total attempts per request, **including the first call**. With `3`, a request that keeps failing with a transient error is sent three times before `RetryExhausted` is raised. `1` disables retries. |
+| `BACKOFF_S` | `0.5` | Base back-off between attempts; the wait before attempt *n + 1* is `BACKOFF_S * n`. |
+
+Upstream guarantees that a transient failure clears within three attempts, so the SLO for
+`fetch_with_retry` assumes all three are made.
